        "name": "avg_npc_047.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 159,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]  雇佣兵的性命可以用价格来衡量吗？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "雇佣兵的性命可以用价格来衡量吗？"
    },
    {
        "id": 160,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_047\", name2=\"avg_npc_046#2\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 161,
        "raw": "[name=\"赫德雷\"]  当然。一直以来。为什么这么问？你可是最懂得这个道理的。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "赫德雷",
        "content": "当然。一直以来。为什么这么问？你可是最懂得这个道理的。"
    },
    {
        "id": 162,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_047\", name2=\"avg_npc_046#2\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 163,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]  可，谁来决定？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "可，谁来决定？"
    },
    {
        "id": 164,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_047\", name2=\"avg_npc_046#2\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 165,
        "raw": "[name=\"赫德雷\"]  战争本身。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "赫德雷",
        "content": "战争本身。"
    },
    {
        "id": 166,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_047\", name2=\"avg_npc_046#2\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 167,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]  是啊......战功，战绩，在厮杀中夺取名利，抬高身价，作为道具被他人认可。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "是啊......战功，战绩，在厮杀中夺取名利，抬高身价，作为道具被他人认可。"
    },
    {
        "id": 168,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]  很无趣。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "很无趣。"
    },
    {
        "id": 169,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]  但以后不再是了。至少我们，没必要再是了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "但以后不再是了。至少我们，没必要再是了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 170,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_047\", name2=\"avg_npc_046#2\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 171,
        "raw": "[name=\"赫德雷\"]  ......什么意思？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "赫德雷",
        "content": "......什么意思？"
    },
    {
        "id": 172,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_047\", name2=\"avg_npc_046#2\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 173,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]  每一个萨卡兹雇佣兵都应该明码标价。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "每一个萨卡兹雇佣兵都应该明码标价。"
    },
    {
        "id": 174,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]  但不必被他人赋予，也不用被他人操纵，他们应该亲手写下自己的价码，用所有与萨卡兹为敌之人的鲜血。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "但不必被他人赋予，也不用被他人操纵，他们应该亲手写下自己的价码，用所有与萨卡兹为敌之人的鲜血。"
